From 5fd4d63aaa13c91456e32135868317f1f67a6497 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Udita <udidua@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 21 May 2025 10:26:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [JGS-582] svid: svid driver

The patch contains a common SVID command
send function which can be used to
send all SVID commands. The patch also
contains template for svid config and isr.
As we develop and test svid  these can be
enhanced later.

Change-Id: I6a2b394a9150aefb294d8e06286807a658bd5991
Signed-off-by: Udita <udidua@habana.ai>
---

